    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a waiter with the shakiest hand in recorded history! Why in the world did you even choose this job?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shaky Service</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect and deliver meals</strong> to the restaurant's hungry, hungry customers! Beware, however, as <strong>gravity is not your ally</strong>. Shake and tilt too much and down to the floor all that food goes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/extras/531d3b5b2bbb6f9a7ab4a2b659f1112b.poster.avif?t=1748867465\" width=620 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/extras/531d3b5b2bbb6f9a7ab4a2b659f1112b.webm?t=1748867465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/extras/531d3b5b2bbb6f9a7ab4a2b659f1112b.mp4?t=1748867465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Race Against Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Those customers won't wait forever</strong>, so make sure you serve them quickly even if you need to be careful with that tray on your way. If you're slow, a couple of <strong>angry table slams</strong> are bound to make things even more difficult for you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/extras/d29ad5ff477e55f9b87164117e19da25.poster.avif?t=1748867465\" width=620 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/extras/d29ad5ff477e55f9b87164117e19da25.webm?t=1748867465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/extras/d29ad5ff477e55f9b87164117e19da25.mp4?t=1748867465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Distractions, Distractions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To make matters more challenging, the restaurant floor may be <strong>full of obstacles</strong>, like unsupervised toys and discarded children. Or was it discarded toys and unsupervised children? Either way, <strong>they'll knock that food right off your tray</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/extras/beae89e54283ed52080564a7d82489f5.poster.avif?t=1748867465\" width=620 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/extras/beae89e54283ed52080564a7d82489f5.webm?t=1748867465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/extras/beae89e54283ed52080564a7d82489f5.mp4?t=1748867465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>All the World's a Stage</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you, as the player, get to enjoy <strong>a variety of the game's stages</strong>, each with <strong>different, increasing challenges</strong>. Get the highest score that you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/extras/7624bce1e5487ed824a20c05069128f5.poster.avif?t=1748867465\" width=620 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/extras/7624bce1e5487ed824a20c05069128f5.webm?t=1748867465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/extras/7624bce1e5487ed824a20c05069128f5.mp4?t=1748867465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Put on your best customer service smile and don't let your shaky hand get in your way of a job well done (and a tip generously received).</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a waiter with the shakiest hand in recorded history! Why in the world did you even choose this job?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shaky Service</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect and deliver meals</strong> to the restaurant's hungry, hungry customers! Beware, however, as <strong>gravity is not your ally</strong>. Shake and tilt too much and down to the floor all that food goes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/extras/531d3b5b2bbb6f9a7ab4a2b659f1112b.poster.avif?t=1748867465\" width=620 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/extras/531d3b5b2bbb6f9a7ab4a2b659f1112b.webm?t=1748867465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/extras/531d3b5b2bbb6f9a7ab4a2b659f1112b.mp4?t=1748867465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Race Against Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Those customers won't wait forever</strong>, so make sure you serve them quickly even if you need to be careful with that tray on your way. If you're slow, a couple of <strong>angry table slams</strong> are bound to make things even more difficult for you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/extras/d29ad5ff477e55f9b87164117e19da25.poster.avif?t=1748867465\" width=620 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/extras/d29ad5ff477e55f9b87164117e19da25.webm?t=1748867465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati