/7624bce1e5487ed824a20c05069128f5.mp4?t=1748867465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Put on your best customer service smile and don't let your shaky hand get in your way of a job well done (and a tip generously received).</strong></p>",
